            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> 1 Zeal</p><p><strong>Range</strong> 30 feet</p><p><strong>Targets</strong> 1 creature</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> Will</p><hr /><p>The target must succeed at a Will save against your class DC. On a failure, nothing happens now — but at the start of its next turn, it takes @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage and is <em>slowed 1</em> for 1 round; on a critical failure the damage is doubled. On a success, nothing happens at all, ever — The Someday forgets what it doesn't get around to.</p>"
